      "headline": "Highlight Clip: Qiao Wang: My Only Crypto Holdings Are BTC and ZEC, at a Roughly 2:1 Ratio Qiao Wang: My Only Crypto Holdings Are BTC and ZEC, at a Roughly 2:1 Ratio Alliance co-founder Qiao Wang told threadguy on October 26 that his only crypto holdings are BTC and ZEC, at roughly 2:1 versus 5:1 previously, mainly because ZEC surged. He prefers holding to selling and paying taxes. Wang remains bullish on Bitcoin over three to five years: governments keep printing money, while Bitcoin's supply stays fixed. He sees Bitcoin's main quantum challenge as governance, including what to do with Satoshi's coins. Wang considers ZEC a potential hedge against Bitcoin's privacy and quantum risks because its developers can keep upgrading the protocol to address new threats. — link",
